                    "product_description": [
                      {
                        "value": "Introducing a vibrant Ceramic Mug that brings a splash of joy to your daily routine! This colorful mug is perfect for coffee lovers, tea enthusiasts, or anyone who appreciates a great beverage. Its glossy finish and lively designs make it a fantastic addition to your kitchen or office, creating an uplifting atmosphere. Whether you're sipping your morning brew or enjoying a cozy evening tea, this mug elevates every sip into a delightful experience. Ideal for gifting on special occasions like birthdays, holidays, or just because – it’s a perfect fit for anyone who loves fun and unique home decor.\n\nProduct features\n- Glossy ceramic finish for a sleek look.\n- Vibrant colors that pop with every design.\n- Microwave-safe for convenient heating.\n- Dishwasher-safe for easy cleanup.\n- Available in two sizes: 11oz and 15oz.\n\nCare instructions\n- Clean in dishwasher or wash by hand with warm water and dish soap",
                        "language_tag": "en_US",
                        "marketplace_id": "ATVPDKIKX0DER"
                      }
